{"about_the_game":"<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/b71f51c2106801564061b4335a6ae68c.poster.avif?t=1713256607\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/b71f51c2106801564061b4335a6ae68c.webm?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/b71f51c2106801564061b4335a6ae68c.mp4?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buy old bunkers and restore them to bring them back to life! Find the one that suits your<br>needs the most, manage the entire renovation process, plan out the new layout and watch<br>your vision come to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/f5f1a5f594f3609b49013b48528fefda.poster.avif?t=1713256607\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/f5f1a5f594f3609b49013b48528fefda.webm?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/f5f1a5f594f3609b49013b48528fefda.mp4?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The possibilities are seemingly endless! Have you always dreamt of a modern, doomsday<br>bunker house? Now You can build one! Would you rather run a profitable business?<br>Renovate the bunker into a rentable warehouse? Maybe a cool, underground bunker-club is<br>what excites you the most? Then build one and decorate it your way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/5ec9fee775d2b8a8111234e71e27ff04.poster.avif?t=1713256607\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/5ec9fee775d2b8a8111234e71e27ff04.webm?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/5ec9fee775d2b8a8111234e71e27ff04.mp4?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are plenty of bunkers to suit your needs. Smaller spaces can be turned into a true<br>apocalypse shelter. Bigger parcels can easily be turned into clubs, museums or even<br>cinemas. There are plenty of available layouts and decora to help you recreate your vision.<br>Bring some freshnes and new life to these old, military spaces!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/4c3b86612a80621724bdc54887efa2e6.poster.avif?t=1713256607\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/4c3b86612a80621724bdc54887efa2e6.webm?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/extras/4c3b86612a80621724bdc54887efa2e6.mp4?t=1713256607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start small and go big! Every entrepreneur has to start somewhere - your first renovation is<br>only the beginning to building your grand renovation empire!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1940270?t=1713256607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1940270?t=1713256607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1713256607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/